    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "9 chord",
      "body": "A dominant 7th chord with the 9th on top is a **9 chord**. C9 is C E G B♭ D.\n\n**Why it matters:** It is the funk chord: James Brown built whole songs on one 9 chord.",
